  "sources": "<details class=\"fsp-sources\"><summary>Research references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://papers.nips.cc/paper/2020/hash/1457c0d6bfcb4967418bfb8ac142f64a-Abstract.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Brown et al. (NeurIPS 2020): Language Models are Few-Shot Learners</a></li><li><a href=\"https://aclanthology.org/2022.emnlp-main.759/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Min et al. (EMNLP 2022): Rethinking the Role of Demonstrations</a></li><li><a href=\"https://aclanthology.org/2022.acl-long.556/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lu et al. (ACL 2022): Few-Shot Prompt Order Sensitivity</a></li></ul></details>",
